    <decisions>
        <description>1- Code will populate Facility
Facility Code   Facility	
Value	        Blank
Is Changed	Is Changed
Is Changed	Old
Is Changed	Blank

2- Facility will populate Code
Facility Code   Facility	
Blank	        Value
Old	                Is Changed
Blank	        Is Changed

3- Both Blank
Facility Code   Facility	
Blank	        Blank

1- Code populates Facility when the Facility Code has a valid or changed value, and the Facility is blank or outdated.
2- Facility populates Code when the Facility has a valid or changed value, and the Facility Code is blank or outdated.
3- Both Blank if neither Facility Code nor Facility has a value.</description>
        <name>Populate_Facility_and_Facility_Code</name>
        <label>Populate Facility and Facility Code</label>
        <locationX>710</locationX>
        <locationY>1919</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Update_current_Record</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Default</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Both_Blank</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Site_Code__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Facility__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Populate_Facility_Facility_Type</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Both Blank</label>
        </rules>
        <rules>
            <name>Code_will_populate_Facility</name>
            <conditionLogic>(1 AND 2) OR ( ( 3 AND 1 ) AND ( ( 4 AND 6 ) OR 5 OR 2 ) )</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Site_Code__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Facility__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Site_Code__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsChanged</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Facility__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsChanged</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Facility__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsChanged</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Facility__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Get_Facility_from_Site_Code</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Code will populate Facility</label>
        </rules>
        <rules>
            <name>Facility_will_populate_Code</name>
            <conditionLogic>(1 AND 2) OR ( ( 4 AND 2 ) OR ( 3 OR 1))</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Site_Code__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Facility__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
